BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (Assistant output:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  In the Valley of Echoes, a great drought withered every vine. The Gardener held his final buck) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    et of precious water, a gift meant for his dying orchard. He looked toward the canyon where ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    the stoic River Spirit resided. Trusting in the ancient cycle of reciprocity, the Gardener p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    oured his bucket into the parched cracks of the canyon floor, sacrificing his immediate poss) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ession for a greater chance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  The River Spirit felt the offering. Recognizing the Gardener's vulnerability, the Spirit did n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ot hoard the gift. Instead, the Spirit channeled the moisture through subterranean veins, ma) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    gnifying its potency threefold, transforming the desert dust into a blossoming oasis. The Sp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    irit then directed a steady stream back to the Gardener's plots, ensuring the orchard would ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    thrive once more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  This was the Law of the Echo: to give is to invite multiplication; to receive is to honor the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    source. The Gardener kept his orchard, and the Spirit kept the valley's lifeblood flowing. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    hey understood that hoarding leads to barrenness, while trust creates a garden where both pr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    osper under the sun. Their bond proved that cooperation is not merely a choice, but the very) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (     rhythm of survival, turning the smallest sacrifice into a legacy of shared abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  **Crafting the Myth**) Tj ET
