BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        asis. The Spirit then directed a steady stream back to the Gardener's plots, ensuring th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        e orchard would thrive once more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      This was the Law of the Echo: to give is to invite multiplication; to receive is to honor ) Tj ET
