BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      In the valley of Oros, the sun scorched the earth until only one well remained. Two travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        ers, Aethel and Finn, reached the water's edge. Aethel held a clay pitcher, while Finn h) Tj ET
