BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        e; if the Giver held back, the Forge grew cold, and if the Receiver hoarded the bounty, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        the Giver would cease the transit entirely. They soon realized that the Forge was not a ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        machine for personal gain, but a mirror reflecting the strength of their bond. Each time) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         the Giver entrusted the full weight of their wealth to the bridge, they signaled a prof) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        ound hope. Each time the Receiver returned an equal share of the harvest, they honored t) Tj ET
