BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (         two cliffs; it connected two souls in a cycle of mutual flourishing. They learned that ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        by consistently dividing the spoils, they kept the path clear of the brambles of greed. ) Tj ET
