BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (         divine energy, tripling the stone's weight into shimmering, life-giving silver.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The Sowers understood that they were bound by the Law of the Echo. If a Sower tossed their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (         stone, they were vulnerable, waiting for the return. If the receiver hoarded the silver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        , the basin would solidify into grey, lifeless rock, forever sealing the potential of th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        e stones. But when the receiver sent back a fair portion of the silver, the basin pulsed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (         with warmth, strengthening the bond between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      This cycle, the Sowers realized, was not about the individual gain of silver, but about th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        e continuity of the ripple. To play the game was to respect the trust of the sender, kno) Tj ET
